WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
List device storage
Connect over USB and open Files. A failed listing is not an empty folder. Confirm the path and selected storage before changing files.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Try a harmless file
Use a small test file. Transfer it, open the returned copy and compare its content. Keep required device files backed up.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Review before running
Scripts run on the device. Read the code first, use a harmless local script and stop it when done. Third-party store downloads have separate trust limits.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Check recovery
Test disconnect and reconnect with disposable files. Inspect the visible result; do not infer a completed transfer from progress alone.
